{"id": "inspection-8ee617e02dfad9eaf334", "title": "Pine Pharmaceuticals, LLC — FDA Form 483 및 API 관찰사항 (실사 종료 2024-09-30)", "country": "미국", "facility_country": "", "agency": "FDA", "published_date": "2024-09-30", "source_title": "Pine Pharmaceuticals, LLC", "source_type": "FDA Form 483", "company": "Pine Pharmaceuticals, LLC", "cfr": "21 CFR 211.103, 21 CFR 211.42(c)(10)(v), 21 CFR 211.110(a), 21 CFR 211.42(c)(10)(iv), 21 CFR 211.42(c)(10)(iii), 21 CFR 211.192, 21 CFR 211.113(b), 21 CFR 211.42(c)(5), 21 CFR 211.100(a)", "ai_summary": "FDA Form 483 원문 기준, Pine Pharmaceuticals, LLC는 무균구역의 HEPA 공기공급·환경모니터링·무균조작 및 세척관리에서 반복적인 결함을 보였습니다. Bevacizumab 등 제품이 불충분한 환경자료와 완제품 시험만으로 출하됐고, 미립자·충전량·환자 불만 및 Endophthalmitis 관련 조사와 CAPA도 부족해 QA의 배치평가, QC 시험대표성, 생산공정 통제가 모두 영향을 받습니다.", "source_summary": "Pine Pharmaceuticals, LLC — 483 (2024-09-30)", "summary_provider": "codex", "summary_model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "summary_status": "success", "summary_coverage": "extracted_body", "summary_quality": "automated_checks_only", "summary_review": {"method": "Codex GPT 요약 + 원문 근거 문구 자동 일치 검사", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-01", "scope": "FDA OII FOIA Electronic Reading Room에 공개된 Form 483 PDF의 추출 본문을 검토했습니다. 자동 텍스트 추출이며 사람의 시각 검수를 뜻하지 않습니다.", "visual_review": false}, "change_summary": "FDA Form 483 원문 기준, Pine Pharmaceuticals, LLC는 무균구역의 HEPA 공기공급·환경모니터링·무균조작 및 세척관리에서 반복적인 결함을 보였습니다. Bevacizumab 등 제품이 불충분한 환경자료와 완제품 시험만으로 출하됐고, 미립자·충전량·환자 불만 및 Endophthalmitis 관련 조사와 CAPA도 부족해 QA의 배치평가, QC 시험대표성, 생산공정 통제가 모두 영향을 받습니다.", "impact_summary": "", "background": "", "purpose": "", "changes_before": "", "changes_after": "", "affected_work": "", "recommendation": "", "key_quote": "", "importance": "높음", "tags": "QA, QC, 생산, RA", "created_at": "2024-09-30", "link": "https://www.fda.gov/media/185430/download", "practical_review": {"impact_summary": {"status": "found", "value": "환경 모니터링 실패가 있었던 여러 배치가 완제품 시험만을 근거로 출하되었고, 베바시주맙 배치에서 높은 가시성 미립자와 충전량 불만이 확인되어 제품 품질 및 무균성 관리에 영향이 우려됩니다.", "evidence": [{"field": "상세.본문발췌", "quote": "b)(4) located in Suite Buffer Room®* as documented in NONC-2023-1393. Your firm released the batch based solely on finished product testing and deemed the impact of this event as minor. In addition, from 12/5/2023 through 08/23/2024 your firm had a total of approximately 16 environmental monitoring failures for personnel, surface and non-viable particulate monitoring within the ISO 5 environment and all batches were released solely based on finished product testing. 2. Your firm failed to conduct environmental monitoring (i.e. swab samples) of critical product contact surfaces within your ISO"}, {"field": "상세.본문발췌", "quote": "represented to possess. Specifically, 1. Your firm's Procedure titled, SOP 061,\"Visual Inspection Finished Products\", vs. 18 dated 27 May 2024 is deficient as you failed to implement adequate specifications to prevent significant product quality issues from occurring. You have been producing and releasing several lots of Bevacizumab drug products with extremely high levels of visible particulates. 2. You failed to adequately investigate and determine the root cause of too many inherent/intrinsic visıble partıculates detects contamınation ın multiple batches of Bevacızumab 1.25mg/0.05ml tound"}, {"field": "상세.본문발췌", "quote": "k Pkwy CITY. STATE, ZIP CODE, COUNTRY TYPE ESTABLISHMENT INSPECTED Tonawanda, NY 14150-5837 Outsourcing Facility 1.Your firm failed to adequately demonstrate that your process is reproducible and can produce products that consistently meets predetermined specifications for Bevacizumab 1.25mg/0.5ml Injection. For example, your firm lacks in-process weight or volume verification utilızing a calibrated instrument. Since September 2023, you have received approximately 260 complaints for either: empty syringe/air pocket (air bubble), depressed syringe/underfilled and insufficient fill volume. Furth"}]}, "affected_work": {"status": "found", "value": "무균 충전구역의 HEPA 공기흐름, ISO 5 환경·작업자 모니터링, 무균 조작, 세척·소독, 베타락탐 제품의 교차오염 방지, 베바시주맙의 육안검사·공정 중 관리 및 수율 산출이 지적 대상입니다.", "evidence": [{"field": "상세.본문발췌", "quote": ".On 9/10/24 during the production of Lidocaine HCL 4% Ophthalmic Solution, 3mL bottle, Lot # (b)(4) Exp: March 5, 2025, on the (b)(4) filling machine, it was observed that open bottles containing sterile product being placed in a non-HEPA filtered (b)(4) from the (b)(4) LFH(b)(4)(filling area) to (b)(4) LFH(b)(4) (capping area). In addition, no environmental monitoring is being conducted on the (b)(4) . Lastly, your firm's smoke study entitled, (b)(4) (2/27/24) demonstrates that the air is flowing from the (b)(4) (capping area) to the (b)4) (filling area) creating turbulent airflow which can i"}, {"field": "상세.본문발췌", "quote": "ng Clean Room Suite(4) LOG-385; dated 03/14/2024 covering cleaning of the ISO 7 clean room from 03/14/2024 to 08/08/2024. Your firm failed to adequately clean and sanitize your capper which is utilized in your (b)(4) aseptic filling process inside your ISO5 laminar flow hood. Your firm only sanitizes the exterior portion of the capper with a sterile wipe and fails to clean the interior metal portion that comes in direct contact with the cap. This inadequate cleaning and sanitization can allow for potential residues from friction to enter the trays containing sterile drug product. During produc"}, {"field": "상세.본문발췌", "quote": "m your non-penicillin beta-lactam suites #148 and 149 into corridor (COS) which is shared with the non-beta-lactam manufacturing suites. In addition, your firm does not have containment control procedures for your non-penicillin beta-lactam drug product manufacturing processes with specifics on how to handle the (b)(4) drug (b)(4) in the commercially available vials used in the manufacturing of your non-penicillin beta-lactam drug products. OBSERVATION 6 There is a failure to thoroughly review the failure of a batch or any of its components to meet any of its specifications whether or not the"}]}, "recommendation": {"status": 